```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant CLI
    participant Coordinator
    participant Discovery
    participant Executor
    participant Metrics
    participant UI

    User->>CLI: ptsd_agent --run-tests --phase 2
    CLI->>Coordinator: initialize(config)
    Coordinator->>Discovery: discover_files(project_root)
    
    Note over Discovery: Fast Scan Phase<br/>(AST parsing)
    loop For each file
        Discovery->>Discovery: estimate_test_count()
        Discovery-->>UI: file_progress
    end
    UI-->>User: ✓ Discovery: ~2,800 tests
    
    Coordinator->>Executor: execute(tests, progress_callback)
    
    Note over Executor: Initialization<br/>(venv, imports)
    Executor->>Executor: detect_venv()
    Executor->>Executor: collect_accurate()
    Executor-->>UI: Collected 556 tests
    
    loop For each test
        Executor->>Executor: run_test()
        
        Note over Executor: After EACH test completes
        Executor->>Metrics: progress_callback(ProgressUpdate)
        Note over Metrics: completed=42<br/>total=556
        Metrics->>UI: update_progress()
        UI-->>User: [▰▰▰▰▱▱] 42/556 (7.5%)
    end
    
    Executor-->>Coordinator: TestResult
    Coordinator->>Metrics: aggregate_results()
    Metrics->>UI: show_summary()
    UI-->>User: ✓ 556 passed | 2 wr | 60 sk
```
